# The default bookmark "Starmind Deployment" (#9 of default_bookmarks.satcmd) on its own, plus a check that #8
# ("Twilight Starship Launch") still frames a rocket (`launch state` -> rockets drawn).
#   python tools/harness/run.py tools/harness/scripts/default_bookmark_starmind_deploy.satcmd --out harness_runs/bm_starmind
#   then merge harness_runs/bm_starmind/bookmarks/bookmarks.json's default_starmind_deploy entry (+ its png) into
#   data/bookmarks/
window 1600x900
bookmark list
bookmark go 8
wait settle
wait 30
launch state
capture bm8_twilight_launch ui=on
time add 20
wait 20
launch state
capture bm8_twilight_launch_20s ui=on

# 9. A sunlit Starmind deployment from Starship (2026-10-20): the ship's door open, the first AI1 satellites leaving
#    the dispenser one by one (45 s apart) over the sunlit Earth. Paused: the ship flies on at 7.7 km/s
#    from a free camera; press play to watch the next ones leave.
drift default
launch deploy filter=Starmind
wait 5
follow offset=-140,300,55
follow aimat=-70,0,25
camera fov=55
time pause
time add 110
wait settle
wait 40
capture bm9_starmind_deploy ui=on
bookmark add Starmind Deployment id=default_starmind_deploy scale=0 paused=1
wait 5
bookmark list
